§§ `s 21ZB and s 21ZC tests`
-- Later disclosure facts columns: involved, disclosed after becoming involved, reasonable excuse for not disclosing before, own initiative, as soon as reasonably practicable,
--                                 an authorised officer forbids continuing, the person continues
`later disclosure, all conditions met` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`later disclosure, no excuse for not disclosing before` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`later disclosure, not on own initiative` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`later disclosure, not as soon as reasonably practicable` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`later disclosure, forbidden and continues` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE
`later disclosure, forbidden but stops` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`later disclosure, not disclosed` MEANS `Later disclosure facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
